  "details": "Gin is an administration theme that provides a modern, clean, and customizable backend UI for editors and site administrators.\n\nThe module doesn't sufficiently sanitize certain attributes, which can lead to a cross-site scripting (XSS) vulnerability.\n\nThis vulnerability is mitigated by the fact that an attacker must have a role with permission to enter HTML tags containing specific data attributes or the `administer menu` permission.",
